      "message": "I\u0027ve tested this out with the debug `libmali` build as described in the bug, and it\u0027s no longer crashing! That said, when I rotate the phone, I do see some flickering, with the following steps in \"Google News\":\n- scroll down to a news link with an embedded video\n- tap on the *headline* (not the video)\n- now I\u0027m on a recycler view with lots of videos\n- rotate into landscape mode\n- scroll up and down\n- when a new video bounces into view, if it has an add, it flickers\n\nWhew - I finally found a similar article on a device without this CL, and it has the same issue!\n\nOver chat, Nicolette suggested that there\u0027s likely more to be done here, but this seems to fix the problem!",
